  "keyFeatures": [
    "Role-based pathways for PIs, CRCs, and research nurses",
    "Comprehensive Knowledge Base covering every study phase",
    "Plain-language SOP summaries with downloadable appendices and forms",
    "Nagano submission platform user guide (step-by-step F11 walkthrough)",
    "Training compliance tracker with certification requirements by study level",
    "Interactive Learning Lab with knowledge checks, team exercises, and inspection prep",
    "Centre for Innovative Medicine (CIM) service catalogue and booking guidance",
    "REDCap and data management guidance",
    "Quebec-specific regulatory context (Civil Code, Law 25, MSSS framework)",
    "Community Connect recordings and ongoing learning sessions"
